  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving law enforcement to recover tigers in Sikhote-Alin Bioshere Zapovednik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this proposal is to improve law enforcement efforts in Sikhote-Alin Biosphere Zapovednik over the next year by increasing the effectiveness of inspectors. This will be done by: 1) purchasing two 4-wheelers to increase access to interior of SABZ in summer; 2) re-initiating the reward system established through SMART with clear minimum standards for foot patrols and hours; 3) establishing a special reward system (Directors Reward) that focuses on concrete results; 4) organizing joint raids with police and the regional wildlife inspector; 5) creating clearly defined teams, with team leaders responsible for results; 6) organizing two trainings per year for the patrol teams; and 7) developing a fitness regime to help build morale.</narrative>
  </description>
